<report>
<title>Summary meta-analysis</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Study</th><th>@stat</th><th>SE</th><th colspan="2"><ci>Approximate @{pc:round2}% CI</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="studies"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{y:roundu}</td><td>@{se:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{from:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{to:roundu}</ci></td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized Effect</th><th>Standard Error</th><th colspan="2">% Weights (fixed, random)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="studies"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{standardized_effect:roundu}</td><td>@{se:roundu}</td><td>@{wt:roundu}</td><td>@{dwt:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>
<subtitle>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</subtitle>
<p>Pooled @stat_fixed = @{rmh:roundu} (<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI = @{from_fixed:roundu} to @{to_fixed:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Z (test @task) = @{z:roundu}  <pval>@{p_fixed:pval}</pval></p>

<subtitle>Non-combinability of studies</subtitle>
<p>Cochran Q = @{qc:roundu}  (df = @df) <pval>@{xp:pval}</pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = @{tausq:roundu}<br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = @{isq:round1}% (<ci>@{pc1:round1}% CI = @{llisq:round1}% to @{ulisq:round1}%</ci>) </p>

<subtitle>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</subtitle>
<p>Pooled @dsstat = @{dsrr:roundu} (<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI = @{dsll:roundu} to @{dsul:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Z (test @stat) = @{dz:roundu}  <pval>@{dp:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="bias">
<subtitle>Bias indicators</subtitle>
<p>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's @{tau:roundu}@{warnTooFewStrata}  <pval>@{p2:pval}</pval><br />
Egger: bias = @{a:roundu} (<ci>@{pc_egger:round2}% CI = @{cl:roundu} to @{cu:roundu}</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
